# Two Tibalts (Valki's back face) in turn: the second is a new object even though it is the same card's other copy (the card's
# ruling). Each makes its own emblem, and each emblem plays only the cards its own Tibalt exiled (CR 114.2, 607.2a): turn 1's +2
# exiles Mountain and Grizzly Bears, turn 3's exiles Swamp and Llanowar Elves, and the emblems list them apart. The legend rule
# puts the first Tibalt into the graveyard, but its emblem stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Valki, God of Lies
Mountain
Valki, God of Lies
Swamp
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Grizzly Bears
Island
Llanowar Elves
Island x20

